<title>NETHERLANDS: CYCLING-RIIS WINS AMSTEL GOLD WORLD CUP RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RIIS WINS AMSTEL GOLD WORLD CUP RACE.</headline>
<dateline>MAASTRICHT, Netherlands 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bjarne Riis of Denmark won the 258-km Amstel Gold World Cup race between Heerlen and Maastricht on Saturday.</p>
</text>
